      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm working on updating our reorder logic for some lithium-ion battery components we get from Shenzhen. I need a way to calculate safety stock since our lead times have been pretty inconsistent lately. Can you give me a standard formula for calculating safety stock and explain how we should factor in lead time variability?",
